# Change evidence

`CHANGELOG.md` is generated from merged PR bodies. Do not prepend to it.
Fill `.github/pull_request_template.md`: What, Why this approach, Verified by,
and Related issue. Include root cause when fixing a bug.

When there is no PR, use `py -3 tools/changes_new.py --kind fix --scope <area>
--title "..."` for a changelog fragment. The collation workflow owns the ledger.
There is no separate problem-ledger entry or fragment requirement.

Unfinished work belongs in GitHub Issues (`deferred-log.mdc`). Do not replace an
issue with a changelog follow-up bullet. Preserve historical entries and keep
secrets and personal data out of all evidence.
